{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415036","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415036","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041503601:1":{"text":"와! 만나서 반가워요, 위대한 블러드 소드!","source_cn":"呀呼！非常荣幸见到您，伟大的蛮血战神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF35302787E1945D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503602:1":{"text":"백전백승에 대적할 자가 없는 브루투스 님!","source_cn":"我们百战百胜，所向披靡的——布鲁特斯大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72D2F895605B3E1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503603:1":{"text":"...크흠, 진정해, 칼라.","source_cn":"……咳咳，冷静点，曼卡拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB0870772672574F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503604:1":{"text":"지금은 군가 축제 기간도 아니고 여긴 사막도 아니니 큰 소리를 내면 곁눈질을 당할 뿐이라고.","source_cn":"现在不是战歌节，这里也不是沙漠，大喊大叫只会让人侧目。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x656D0E9976D03F53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503605:1":{"text":"게다가 이렇게 편안한 환경에서까지 군신이라고 부를 필요는 없어. ","source_cn":"而且，这种放松的环境，就不用再叫什么战神了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18B194FA9A958D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503606:1":{"text":"알~겠습니다! 참 겸손한 분이네요!","source_cn":"明——白！您真是个低调的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C1AFC49D3030E6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503607:1":{"text":"그럼 인터뷰에서 뭐라고 불러주길 바라시나요?\n슈퍼 라이언? 라이언 킹? 검객 브루투스?","source_cn":"那之后的采访里，您喜欢什么样的称呼？\\n超级狮子？夺命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08D5BFEFEA952BE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041503608:1":{"text":"...그냥 군신이라고 부르게...","source_cn":"……你还是叫我战神吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x243E2DBFDCCFC007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"칼라","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"브루투스","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}